{"ordinal":316,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457924583430","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_1_2_00e31ed","source":"Phone: Её тоже сожгли.","target":"Phone: Și pe ea au ars-o.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":317,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457924583429","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_1_2_0228678","source":"Phone: Получается, он был Гостем. Так же, как и наша доченька.","target":"Phone: Așadar, era un Musafir. La fel ca fetița noastră.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":318,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457924583428","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_1_2_092e9d7","source":"Phone: Никто не будет жечь людей просто так.","target":"Phone: Nimeni nu ar arde oameni fără motiv.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":319,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457924583427","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_1_096abd7","source":"Нет, какие-то ебанаты сожгли его ни за что","target":"Nu, niște nenorociți l-au ars fără niciun motiv","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":320,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457924583426","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_1_0810bdf","source":"В смысле, тоже?","target":"Cum adică și el?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":321,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457924583425","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_1_0fddfd8","source":"Phone: Он... он тоже, что ли, был Гостем?","target":"Phone: El... era și el un Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":322,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457924583424","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_01bb092","source":"У меня тут девочка, у которой умер отец","target":"Am aici o fetiță căreia i-a murit tatăl","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":323,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389132","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_0d1c5a1","source":"Я хочу позвать вашу дочь к нам в гости. Её подруга просит","target":"Vreau s-o invit pe fiica dumneavoastră la noi. Prietena ei o cheamă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":324,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389131","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_003260e","source":"Phone: Что? Зачем это вам нужно поговорить с ней?","target":"Phone: Ce? De ce vreți să vorbiți cu ea?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":325,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389130","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_016cbd7","source":"Здравствуйте, пустите вашу дочь в гости поиграть с её подругой?","target":"Bună ziua, îi dați voie fiicei dumneavoastră să vină să se joace cu prietena ei?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":326,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389129","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_065d61e","source":"Здравствуйте, можно поговорить с вашей дочерью?","target":"Bună ziua, pot vorbi cu fiica dumneavoastră?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-003.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":327,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389128","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_0909691","source":"Phone: Алло?","target":"Phone: Alo?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":328,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389127","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_X_0d6e352","source":"Phone: До свидания. И сил вам.","target":"Phone: La revedere. Și multă putere.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":329,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389126","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_X_0eff429","source":"Phone: Ещё раз спасибо вам за эту беседу.","target":"Phone: Vă mulțumesc încă o dată pentru această conversație.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":330,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389125","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_X_0bbbedc","source":"Phone: …","target":"Phone: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":331,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389124","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_9_04b7d32","source":"Phone: Не представляю, насколько вы ненавидите отца, если хотите, чтобы дом сгорел…","target":"Phone: Nu-mi pot închipui cât de mult vă urâți tatăl, dacă vreți să ardă casa…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":332,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389123","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_9_0bae81d","source":"Phone: …","target":"Phone: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":333,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389122","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_8_016dd9f","source":"Phone: Мне… тяжело представить, через что вы прошли…","target":"Phone: Mi-e… greu să-mi imaginez prin ce ați trecut…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":334,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389121","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_8_04cd294","source":"Phone: …","target":"Phone: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":335,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389120","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_7_0897b68","source":"Лучше бы он сгорел","target":"Mai bine ar fi ars","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":336,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457916194827","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_7_0be0bc5","source":"Это так","target":"Așa este","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":337,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457916194826","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_7_03a31aa","source":"Phone: Я…очень сочувствую вам... Похоже, вы очень не рады тому, что этот дом достался вам.","target":"Phone: Îmi… pare foarte rău pentru dumneavoastră... Se pare că nu vă bucură deloc faptul că această casă a ajuns la dumneavoastră.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":338,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457916194825","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_7_01c38a1","source":"Phone: …","target":"Phone: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":339,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457916194824","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_6_0df66fb","source":"Теперь, всё что осталось от них, – это дом","target":"Acum, tot ce a rămas de la ei e casa","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-004.json","reviewResult":"read-with-phone-scene-and-branch-context"}
